Do you think it's a bad idea to spend a lot of money on GPS equipment, and then pay a monthly subscription that is often unreasonably high?
Just want to see where your car in real time?
Do you just want to know where your drivers are and nothing more?
Monitoring your car or fleet does NOT have to be the most expensive thing!
Paying too much for GPS app and tracking equipment can often be a big burden when you have other expenses.
...hundreds of euros per month on a GPS apps and devices, especially now that everything is getting more expensive day by day, just to see where your car is doesn't sound too great.
What can you do with the cheapest GPS equipment?
Whether you want to see the real location of your personal car or your fleet vehicles, our GPS app can help you with the following essential information:
	•	Real-time vehicle view on the map;
	•	Speed record;
	•	Location sharing;
	•	Routes visualisation;
	•	Low baterry voltage alert;
	•	Mileage history;
	•	Travel report generation;
	•	Generate drivers work schedule report;
	•	Generating activity report by countries;
Download the FlimoGPS mobile application to track and manage your fleet in the most economic way from anywhere and anytime.
*Notes: FlimoGPS subscription is required to use this application!
If you do not have a FlimoGPS subscription and you are interested, please contact us at vanzari@flimogps.ro.
